Z||000000||Denny||07-13-2001||10:54 PM||||Please join us for the 2nd Annual Fiero Dutch Classic on Saturday, August<BR>18th, 2001, at Zinn's Park in Denver, PA, right next to the PA Turnpike.<P>For more info, please visit <A HREF="http://www.fieropride.com/dutch_classic.htm." TARGET=_blank>http://www.fieropride.com/dutch_classic.htm.</A> <P>See you there!<P>Denny<P>**************************<BR>Gonna keep this near the top so nobody forgets!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>[This message has been edited by Denny (edited 07-14-2001).]<p>[This message has been edited by Denny (edited 07-14-2001).]||||reg||4
