Z||000007||grgoyl86||07-22-2001||09:41 PM||||I got some new news for this one!<P>After leaving the picnic today (thanks skitime, it was great!), we drove up to Zinn's to check out a motel there. The Pennsylvania Dutch Motel is right across the road from Zinn's (the location of the show). It's a quaint little place, with 20 rooms. We took a look at one, and it was clean. Each room has two double beds. $60 a night.<BR>We booked a room for the weekend, and encourage others to do so.<BR>To make your own reservations, call 717-336-5559.<P>See ya all there!!!||||reg||3
