Z||000023||Denny||07-27-2001||09:35 PM||||Anyone attending the Fiero Dutch Classic this year and needing a room, here is good motel info from Bob Schlag:<P>Today we drove up to Zinn's to check out a motel there. The Pennsylvania Dutch Motel is right across the road from Zinn's (the location of the show). It's a quaint little place, with 20 rooms. We took a look at one, and it was clean. Each room has two double beds. $60 a night.<P>We booked a room for the weekend, and encourage others to do so.<BR>To make your own reservations, call 717-336-5559.<P>See ya all there!!!<P>Bob Schlag||||reg||14
